.TH "libnvmf_context_set_connection_from_tid" 9 "libnvmf_context_set_connection_from_tid" "July 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_context_set_connection_from_tid \- Set connection and identity from a TID
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "int" libnvmf_context_set_connection_from_tid
.BI "(struct libnvmf_context *fctx "  ","
.BI "const struct libnvmf_tid *tid "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "fctx" 12
Fabrics context
.IP "tid" 12
Transport ID to copy from
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Equivalent to \fBlibnvmf_context_set_connection\fP followed by
\fBlibnvmf_context_set_hostnqn\fP, reading every field from \fItid\fP.
.SH "RETURN"
0 on success, -EINVAL if \fIfctx\fP or \fItid\fP is NULL.
